   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Rules for number with indefinites",
     "texto": [
      "**Ogni** and **qualche** only take nouns in the **singular**: **ogni studente** (every student); **qualche giorno** (some day / a few days). Never say *qualche giorni*.",
      "**Troppo/a/i/e** expresses excess and agrees in gender and number: **troppo traffico** (too much traffic); **troppe persone** (too many people)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Everything with an article versus indefinites",
     "texto": [
      "**Tutto** requires the definite article before a definite noun: **tutto il giorno** (all day); **tutta la notte** (all night); **tutti gli studenti** (all the students)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
